# 🌸 Flowerama | Retail Sales & Profitability Analysis

**Microsoft Excel | Tableau | Financial Analytics | Retail Operations**

A semester-long business analytics project evaluating the financial performance of a local Flowerama retail store through revenue analysis, expense tracking, and data visualization.

